// 照片评论表
// 所有读写均通过 wallpaper-action 云函数（管理员权限），clientDB 全部禁止
{
	"bsonType": "object",
	"required": ["wallpaper_id", "user_id", "content"],
	"permission": {
		"read": false,
		"create": false,
		"update": false,
		"delete": false
	},
	"properties": {
		"_id": {
			"description": "ID，系统自动生成"
		},
		"wallpaper_id": {
			"title": "照片ID",
			"description": "wallpapers._id",
			"bsonType": "string",
			"foreignKey": "wallpapers._id"
		},
		"user_id": {
			"title": "评论用户ID",
			"description": "uni-id-users._id",
			"bsonType": "string",
			"foreignKey": "uni-id-users._id"
		},
		"author": {
			"title": "评论者快照",
			"description": "冗余昵称与头像fileID，避免用户改昵称后历史评论失真",
			"bsonType": "object",
			"required": ["name", "avatar"],
			"properties": {
				"name": {
					"bsonType": "string",
					"title": "昵称"
				},
				"avatar": {
					"bsonType": "file",
					"title": "头像"
				}
			}
		},
		"content": {
			"title": "评论内容",
			"bsonType": "string",
			"description": "1-100字"
		},
		"parent_id": {
			"title": "父评论ID",
			"description": "顶级评论无此字段；回复时指向顶级评论 wallpaper_comments._id（两级盖楼，回复回复也挂在同一顶级评论下）",
			"bsonType": "string",
			"foreignKey": "wallpaper_comments._id"
		},
		"reply_to": {
			"title": "被回复人快照",
			"description": "仅回复记录存在：{uid:被回复用户ID, name:被回复时昵称}，由云函数根据 parentId/replyId 解析，客户端不可信",
			"bsonType": "object",
			"properties": {
				"uid": {
					"bsonType": "string",
					"title": "被回复用户ID"
				},
				"name": {
					"bsonType": "string",
					"title": "被回复用户昵称"
				}
			}
		},
		"create_time": {
			"title": "评论时间",
			"bsonType": "timestamp"
		}
	}
}
